Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Fix workspace source event custody and isolate
 materialized trees

Proof: red holder-event and ancestor config regressions; 134 focused tests pass. Seven targeted mutations killed: holder, manifest fields, custody revision, nested target, occupied target, task reservation, dirty destination. Preserve existing holder and return-home paths; new worktrees live beside the registered clone.
